  "description": {
    "text": "A half deck released for the film Lucario and the Mystery of Mew, first at Japan's Pokémon Centers on 16 July 2005 and in other shops from 5 August 2005. It holds Pokémon of the film's characters, such as Ash's Grovyle, Kidd's Weavile and Brock's Forretress, Pokémon of Rota, and two holofoil cards, Rota's Mew and Aura's Lucario. It brought the first cards of three fourth-generation Pokémon, Mime Jr., Bonsly and Weavile, and came with a rulebook, damage and status counters and a coin.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Aura's Lucario (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 4 July 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260704122610/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Movie_Commemoration_VS_Pack:_Aura%27s_Lucario_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A black \"Vs\" symbol at the bottom right, and a number out of 020",
    "sources": [
      {
